WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:12.902
Mom went to the library.

2
00:00:12.903 --> 00:00:21.879
She brought home books about stars and planets.

3
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:26.975
"Let's have a backyard star party tonight!" Mom said.

4
00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:31.419
"Yay!" The kids cheered.

5
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.235
"Great idea!" Dad said.

6
00:00:35.236 --> 00:00:39.119
"I'll find our telescope."

7
00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:44.139
He went up to the attic to look for it.

8
00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:49.215
"I'll make star and moon cookies," Aunt Judy said.

9
00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:53.516
Harry helped Aunt Judy mix the cookie dough.

10
00:00:53.517 --> 00:00:57.187
Emmy helped Oliver read the books.

11
00:00:57.188 --> 00:01:04.034
"I like the moon," Oliver said.

12
00:01:04.035 --> 00:01:09.286
"I hope it's big and bright tonight."

13
00:01:09.287 --> 00:01:15.291
"My favorite planet is Saturn," Emmy said.

14
00:01:15.292 --> 00:01:19.092
"I hope we see its rings with the telescope."

15
00:01:19.093 --> 00:01:24.576
Aunt Judy put the cookies in the oven.

16
00:01:24.577 --> 00:01:31.178
Harry sat down and looked at the books.

17
00:01:31.179 --> 00:01:36.022
"It's fun to find stars in the night sky," he said.

18
00:01:36.023 --> 00:01:39.647
"I hope we see the Big Dipper."

19
00:01:39.648 --> 00:01:44.077
That night the Carters went outside.

20
00:01:44.078 --> 00:01:47.647
Dad brought the telescope.

21
00:01:47.648 --> 00:01:50.713
Aunt Judy brought the cookies.

22
00:01:50.714 --> 00:01:57.023
Mom brought a blanket for everyone to sit on.

23
00:01:57.024 --> 00:02:01.587
"I don't see any stars!" Harry said.

24
00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:06.174
"I don't see the moon!" Oliver said.

25
00:02:06.175 --> 00:02:11.849
"It's too cloudy tonight to see anything," Dad said.

26
00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:15.960
Everyone was disappointed.

27
00:02:15.961 --> 00:02:20.867
"Well, I see some stars and moons," Emmy said.

28
00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:26.085
She pointed to the cookies.

29
00:02:26.086 --> 00:02:33.621
"We can still have a party tonight!"
